files: table_leg.glb (model/gltf-binary), table_leg.generated_image_url.jpeg (image/jpeg)
each file lands in your folder under its name, and its `fetched:` line names its /cdn/ address, the one the world uses. With no `fetched:` line below, `spawn tripo status 56fe44d9-5412-443c-9632-5e086b2d0eb9 --out table_leg.glb` lands them.
facing: a workshop file, so it faces the way its bytes do: Tripo puts the side that table_leg.generated_image_url.jpeg shows on +X. Set model.forward to where the subject faces there: toward you "+x", away "-x", to the picture's left "+z", to its right no forward.
